  "keyFeatures": [
    "GPU-accelerated rendering via CUDA (NVIDIA) and HIP (AMD)",
    "Scene-based compositing system with reusable math, media, and physics scenes",
    "Declarative StateManager with dependency-graph-driven frame interpolation",
    "Two-tier time control: Macroblocks (audio-aligned) and Microblocks (visual transitions)",
    "Mandatory smoketest pass before every full render",
    "Built-in LaTeX rendering via MicroTeX and SVG pipeline",
    "FFmpeg-based video/audio encoding with subtitle output",
    "30+ built-in scene types: Mandelbrot, Rubik's cube, graph spread, pendulum, geodesics, and more",
    "Docker and WSL2 support for cross-platform use"
  ],
